{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Archimedean.SingleVolumeIrrationality","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SingleVolumeIrrationality","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":8,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SingleVolumeIrrationality.volBorromean_irrational","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SingleVolumeIrrationality.volBorromean_irrational","kind":"theorem","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SingleVolumeIrrationality.lean#L51-L51","doc":"$\\mathrm{Vol}(\\mathcal{B}_3) \\notin \\mathbb{Q}$. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SingleVolumeIrrationality.vol52_irrational","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SingleVolumeIrrationality.vol52_irrational","kind":"theorem","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SingleVolumeIrrationality.lean#L49-L49","doc":"$\\mathrm{Vol}(5_2) \\notin \\mathbb{Q}$. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SingleVolumeIrrationality.vol41_irrational","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SingleVolumeIrrationality.vol41_irrational","kind":"theorem","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SingleVolumeIrrationality.lean#L47-L47","doc":"$\\mathrm{Vol}(4_1) \\notin \\mathbb{Q}$. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SingleVolumeIrrationality.volBorromean","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SingleVolumeIrrationality.volBorromean","kind":"def","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SingleVolumeIrrationality.lean#L45-L45","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SingleVolumeIrrationality.vol52","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SingleVolumeIrrationality.vol52","kind":"def","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SingleVolumeIrrationality.lean#L44-L44","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SingleVolumeIrrationality.vol41","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SingleVolumeIrrationality.vol41","kind":"def","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SingleVolumeIrrationality.lean#L43-L43","doc":"**Content statement** (from manuscript):\n\n      $$\n  \\mathrm{Vol}(4_1) = 2\\,\\mathrm{Cl}_2(\\pi/3) \\notin \\mathbb{Q},\n  \\qquad\n  \\mathrm{Vol}(5_2) \\notin \\mathbb{Q},\n  \\qquad\n  \\mathrm{Vol}(\\mathcal{B}_3) \\notin \\mathbb{Q}.\n$$\n\n      The fields assert the conjecture's shape: irrationality of\n      each volume.  The three volume fields are data pinned by the\n      manuscript's definitions ($2\\,\\mathrm{Cl}_2(\\pi/3)$ etc.);\n      tying them to formalised Clausen/Lobachevsky values is the\n      remaining refinement. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SingleVolumeIrrationality.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SingleVolumeIrrationality.mk","kind":"ctor","line":26,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SingleVolumeIrrationality.lean#L26-L26","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SingleVolumeIrrationality","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SingleVolumeIrrationality","kind":"class","line":23,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SingleVolumeIrrationality.lean#L23-L51","doc":"Irrationality of a single hyperbolic knot volume\n\nConjectural class — see [`conj:single-volume-irrationality`](../../../quantum-observable-universe/archimedean-universe/single-volume-irrationality.md). ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:conj:single-volume-irrationality","label":"conj:single-volume-irrationality","md":"quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/single-volume-irrationality.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}